   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Mme Boua accueille Clara à midi.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແມ່ບົວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຄລາຣາກິນເຂົ້າແລ້ວບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Clara kǐn-khâo lɛ̏ɛw bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຍັງເທື່ອເຈົ້າ</span><span class=\"rom\">Nyáng thʉ̄a jâo.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແມ່ບົວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມາກິນເຂົ້ານຳກັນເດີ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Máa kǐn-khâo nám kǎn dɤ̌ɤ!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໄດ້ບໍ? ຂອບໃຈຫຼາຍໆ</span><span class=\"rom\">Dâay bɔ̌ɔ? Khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy lǎay-lǎay.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແມ່ບົວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ກິນເຂົ້າໜຽວເປັນບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Kǐn khâo-nǐaw pěn bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເປັນເຈົ້າ ແຊບຫຼາຍ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Pěn jâo. Sɛ̂ɛp lǎay!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແມ່ບົວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເຜັດບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Phēt bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບໍ່ເຜັດ ພໍດີ</span><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̀ɔ phēt. Phɔ́ɔ-dǐi.</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Mme Boua</b> — Clara, tu as mangé ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Pas encore.<br><b>Mme Boua</b> — Viens manger avec nous !<br><b>Clara</b> — C&#x27;est vrai ? Merci beaucoup.<br><b>Mme Boua</b> — Tu sais manger le riz gluant ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Oui. C&#x27;est très bon !<br><b>Mme Boua</b> — C&#x27;est trop pimenté ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Non, c&#x27;est parfait.</p></details>"
